      <h2 id="intro-h">Introduction</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>My name is Joshua Collado, and I’m a dual enrollment student at UTRGV through the Science Academy, studying engineering and computer science. I’m from South Texas, and I want to use technology to make life better, smarter and more collaborative.</p>
        <p>I worked with NASA HUNCH on an Inventory Chain System that took me to the Houston HQ twice. I built a virtual reality training experience with Los Alamos National Laboratory, developed a city website with RECON Technologies, and co-created a STEM sandbox for elementary schools with Nerdvana.</p>
        <p>Right now I’m building Evie, a personal AI assistant that connects Android and Windows into one home automation network. My goal is to become a computer engineer who builds systems that actually change how people live and work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

